    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mountain View covers only 12 square blocks, once a tiny retail tax base that relied on traffic tickets for police funding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mountain_View%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2009, the town faced a debt crisis, with police salaries paid late and 40% of businesses closed.",
